RequestHeader set X-Tizavi-Client-Address "expr=%{REMOTE_ADDR}"
RewriteEngine On
RewriteCond %{HTTP:X-Forwarded-Proto} !https [NC]
RewriteRule ^ https://xn--80aendd9c.xn--p1ai%{REQUEST_URI} [R=307,L,NE]
PassengerEnabled on
PassengerAppType node
PassengerStartupFile app.cjs
PassengerAppRoot /home/LOGIN/apps/tizavi/current
PassengerNodejs /usr/local/bin/node22
PassengerAppEnv production
Options -MultiViews
Require all granted
